":"Keluarga saya saling membantu.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"ibu bapa","meaning":"父母","theme":"T05","type":"nama","usage":"peranan ibu bapa; sokongan ibu bapa","example":"Ibu bapa memainkan peranan penting dalam pendidikan anak.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"adik-beradik","meaning":"兄弟姐妹","theme":"T05","type":"nama","usage":"hubungan adik-beradik","example":"Mereka adik-beradik yang saling menyayangi.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"jiran","meaning":"邻居","theme":"T14","type":"nama","usage":"hubungan dengan jiran; membantu jiran","example":"Kita hendaklah menghormati jiran.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"masyarakat","meaning":"社会；民众","theme":"T14","type":"nama","usage":"anggota masyarakat; kesedaran masyarakat","example":"Masyarakat perlu menjaga kebersihan kawasan.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"komuniti","meaning":"社区群体","theme":"T14","type":"nama","usage":"komuniti setempat; aktiviti komuniti","example":"Komuniti setempat bekerjasama membersihkan taman.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"penduduk","meaning":"居民","theme":"T14","type":"nama","usage":"penduduk setempat; keselamatan penduduk","example":"Penduduk bergotong-royong pada hujung minggu.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"generasi","meaning":"一代；世代","theme":"T14","type":"nama","usage":"generasi muda; generasi akan datang","example":"Warisan perlu dipelihara untuk generasi akan datang.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"golongan","meaning":"群体；阶层","theme":"T14","type":"nama","usage":"golongan remaja; golongan masyarakat","example":"Golongan remaja digalakkan menyertai aktiviti sihat.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"kerjasama","meaning":"合作","theme":"T14","type":"nama","usage":"menjalinkan kerjasama; kerjasama masyarakat","example":"Kerjasama semua pihak diperlukan untuk menjayakan program itu.","source":"DSKP/KSSR/KSSM/UASA"},{"word":"perpaduan","meaning":"团结","theme":"T22","type":"nama","usage":"memupuk perpaduan; perp